# Canonical project memory + plan docs are load-bearing collaboration state — track them
# (scratch under memory/backup_*/ and memory/tmp/ stays ignored via the bare *.md rule).
!memory/*.md
!docs/superpowers/plans/*.md
*.txt
*.tar
*.png

